    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Measures spans of CPU time.</para>
<para>The internal record of time can overflow quickly. If <ref refid="classclock__t" kindref="compound">clock_t</ref> is 32 bits unsigned and CLOCKS_PER_TIC is one million then overflow will occur after 71 minutes. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
